        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b19ed9c6-3144-3145-a34d-4a66bceba9de",
                "word": "Amazonie",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8864fe5a-d8e3-3f3c-abd2-ccef835d6215",
                        "entry_id": "b19ed9c6-3144-3145-a34d-4a66bceba9de",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Vaste plaine d’Amérique du Sud, arrosée par l’Amazone et ses affluents, limitée par le plateau des Guyanes, le plateau brésilien et la chaîne des Andes ; son climat chaud et humide en fait le domaine de la forêt dense."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "04a747aa-4af0-43af-83ea-3c21d9b45ba9",
                                "sense_id": "8864fe5a-d8e3-3f3c-abd2-ccef835d6215",
                                "text": "Les régions orientales de la Colombie, situées au-delà de la cordillère, ainsi que le Trapèze amazonien, ont été pendant des siècles considérées comme des « territoires sauvages », des espaces vides ou des « enfers verts ». Même aujourd'hui, quand on pense aux Indiens de l’Amazonie colombienne, on les imagine souvent comme des groupes d'individus isolés."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76bc3b21-eb5e-4404-bc6c-b174ad0a230e",
                                "sense_id": "8864fe5a-d8e3-3f3c-abd2-ccef835d6215",
                                "text": "Mais cela aura des conséquences dans ses relations avec le très susceptible président brésilien, qui n’aime pas qu’on lui dise qu’il a les mains sales en raison du désastre écologique actuel en Amazonie"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "815f323b-9369-4421-902e-4453d134d5a6",
                        "source_entry_id": "b19ed9c6-3144-3145-a34d-4a66bceba9de",
                        "source_sense_id": "8864fe5a-d8e3-3f3c-abd2-ccef835d6215",
                        "target_lang_word": "Amazon",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Amazon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f540898-09a7-3f33-a10e-d3392f850dd9",
                                        "entry_id": "1a262c2a-cda8-3724-9c87-b02f67d71a63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of a mythical race of female warriors inhabiting the Black Sea area."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Greek"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "463df69e-c7b2-41a7-9805-e353995067e4",
                                                "sense_id": "2f540898-09a7-3f33-a10e-d3392f850dd9",
                                                "text": "When, therefore, one envisions a matriarchy, one should not conjure up visions of a gang of Amazons lopping off breasts and testicles to rule by force of arms."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d12d51fd-e914-3cba-a331-d6f12b315496",
                                        "entry_id": "1a262c2a-cda8-3724-9c87-b02f67d71a63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female warrior."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b1e2c5c-00d0-4be2-a5c2-8b594c5f64ee",
                                                "sense_id": "d12d51fd-e914-3cba-a331-d6f12b315496",
                                                "text": "In some parts of Africa, Asia, and South America, amazon cultures still existed during the Middle Ages, such as that ruled by Queen Nzingha in Angola, who led her amazon army against the Portuguese in a series of wars during the first half of the seventeenth century. In Dahomey also in traditionally gynarchal West Africa, the army was made up of amazons even through the nineteenth century."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1eb7ad2b-52f9-3ece-8fee-788f968bd740",
                                        "entry_id": "1a262c2a-cda8-3724-9c87-b02f67d71a63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tall, strong, or athletic woman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Amazon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5ba3c3f-4f95-38df-adf2-a87fdeeda5ad",
                                        "entry_id": "f6f7b66f-3ec2-379f-8c4b-f730807660b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A river in South America, that flows through Brazil for about 4000 miles to the Atlantic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1c7d8b4-aa60-36b3-8f25-0899a3c5b275",
                                        "entry_id": "f6f7b66f-3ec2-379f-8c4b-f730807660b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A region including much of this river; specifically, the region of the Amazon Rainforest, or of the Amazon River Basin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "318a2ea7-b71f-41dd-806f-4c76f1391a75",
                                                "sense_id": "e1c7d8b4-aa60-36b3-8f25-0899a3c5b275",
                                                "text": "Amazon milk frog"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e9d47dc-0419-442f-a27a-944da09c65fe",
                                                "sense_id": "e1c7d8b4-aa60-36b3-8f25-0899a3c5b275",
                                                "text": "In February, a young man from an isolated Indigenous tribe in Brazil made brief contact with the outside world before returning to the Amazon rainforest."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Amazon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55e812b9-ee6f-3776-87b1-6a9fecd166c6",
                                        "entry_id": "4fcb10b0-3c24-3fd1-9a26-09305c14b6f1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of the large parrots from the genus Amazona."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Amazon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "289e0b1f-93d7-382b-bb1a-fb689f714f2b",
                                        "entry_id": "dc0eea04-82cc-3468-9e35-6d38f7d370fe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Amazon.com Inc., a very large Internet retailer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e42d19b6-0195-45b7-af4c-ef769635fd97",
                                                "sense_id": "289e0b1f-93d7-382b-bb1a-fb689f714f2b",
                                                "text": "Google is one of several Big Tech firms that has made an aggressive push into gaming in recent years, along with Amazon (AMZN), Apple (AAPL) and Facebook (FB)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Amazon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "604040c3-6249-3196-b067-3f9569b7d2e6",
                                        "entry_id": "05234c9e-66d9-32f5-8491-7794587a031d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To overwhelm or obliterate, in the context of an Internet start-up vastly outperforming its brick and mortar competition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22cfa0c6-5e11-4d1b-a676-1d4e90f48c75",
                                                "sense_id": "604040c3-6249-3196-b067-3f9569b7d2e6",
                                                "text": "Those who hesitate risk being \"amazoned,\" forfeiting business to an Internet newcomer, in the way that bookstore chains have lost ground to Amazon.com Inc., the online bookseller."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6bbf302-9795-4533-bbc6-031a5b26addf",
                                                "sense_id": "604040c3-6249-3196-b067-3f9569b7d2e6",
                                                "text": "Venture capitalists' desks are thick with business plans promising ‘we're going to Amazon the insurance/travel/property business...’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58815bbf-e10c-46dd-abbc-89879307d0f2",
                                                "sense_id": "604040c3-6249-3196-b067-3f9569b7d2e6",
                                                "text": "Take the example of MetalSite.com, which is owned by steel companies. The steel companies aren't getting \"Amazoned\" by a start-up but, rather, they are doing the \"Amazoning\" within their own industry."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8675296-cbbc-4a71-9b42-9cf5d87e167b",
                                                "sense_id": "604040c3-6249-3196-b067-3f9569b7d2e6",
                                                "text": "Amazon.com may soon be \"amazoning\" a few more industries."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04bd198b-1af3-4eea-aa48-37ea67f3f3ca",
                                                "sense_id": "604040c3-6249-3196-b067-3f9569b7d2e6",
                                                "text": "Gone are the days when they agonized about being \"Amazoned\", or blind-sided by a dot-com ...."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e268ced4-6d00-4114-9bfd-d7624d3e84cf",
                                                "sense_id": "604040c3-6249-3196-b067-3f9569b7d2e6",
                                                "text": "In other industries, established companies are pulling people and money away from their Internet operations, as their fear of being \"Amazoned\" by start-ups has subsided."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d204db3d-f464-4b6f-96fa-71baf95d208a",
                                                "sense_id": "604040c3-6249-3196-b067-3f9569b7d2e6",
                                                "text": "Meanwhile, traditional companies would be obliterated — \"Amazoned\" — by Internet upstarts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fa42c34-a710-4815-a555-fc2f5d222048",
                                                "sense_id": "604040c3-6249-3196-b067-3f9569b7d2e6",
                                                "text": "\"Everybody was afraid of getting Amazoned,\" Mr. Landan said. \"They didn't want to get left behind.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3901445-a1d7-302c-b5be-1319b16a09ee",
                                        "entry_id": "05234c9e-66d9-32f5-8491-7794587a031d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To order (something) on Amazon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86452ebf-7973-4a50-9017-8625a33c8f07",
                                                "sense_id": "b3901445-a1d7-302c-b5be-1319b16a09ee",
                                                "text": "[…] “There are people who Uber everywhere, who Seamless everything, who Amazon everything, and render their lives completely smooth.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
